Subject: [PATCH] pid: backport process descriptors for Linux service startup

Adapt pidfd open, clone, poll, signal and wait support from Linux 5.4
stable 9e3157c56ec7917e6a80ea53a8bd752e0037f2cb. This includes delayed
fd installation, cgroup failure cleanup and exit-before-notify ordering.
Original work: Christian Brauner, Jann Horn, Joel Fernandes, Daniel
Colascione, Suren Baghdasaryan and upstream contributors.

Keep Pico's existing fork signature and 128-byte siginfo representation.
Wire ARM64 and ARM32 compatibility numbers without adding clone3.
Both pidfd signal paths retain existing task permission checks.

